00:13:33.479 --> 00:13:35.231
<font color="white">Selamat malam, Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:50.913 --> 00:13:53.874
{\an8}<font color="white">12 JAM SEBELUM MOGOK KERJA</font><font color="white"></font>

00:13:55.709 --> 00:13:58.420
<font color="white">Cucu kesayangan Nenek, Ga-eul…</font><font color="white"></font>

