<font color="white"><i>Ya ampun.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:29.952 --> 00:14:32.246
<font color="white">Yang benar saja. Pemandian umum?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:32.329 --> 00:14:34.790
<font color="white">Susu pisang? Astaga.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:14:34.874 --> 00:14:36.125
<font color="white">Beruntung dia bisa pulang.</font><font color="white"></font>

