00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:07.740
<font color="white">Untuk sementara kulepas. Aku belum…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:07.823 --> 00:15:09.450
<font color="white">Menunggu sampai waktunya pulang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:09.533 --> 00:15:10.701
<font color="white">Ya, Pak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:10.784 --> 00:15:13.954
<font color="white">Bagus, kau memang bertanggung jawab.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:14.038 --> 00:15:16.832
<font color="white">Tentu saja.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Makanya dia juga dipanggil si imut Ma.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

