00:15:47.321 --> 00:15:48.155
<font color="white">Baik, Pak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:49.114 --> 00:15:50.741
<font color="white">Baiklah, hati-hati.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:15:55.704 --> 00:15:59.291
