<font color="white">Imut!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:16:44.211 --> 00:16:45.754
<font color="white">Katakan bahwa aku imut.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:16:46.338 --> 00:16:47.297
<font color="white">Kau juga imut.</font><font color="white"></font>

