00:16:49.466 --> 00:16:51.844
<font color="white">- Kau sangat imut, Kak.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Sungguh imut.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:16:52.886 --> 00:16:53.762
<font color="white">Ini akan segera berakhir.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:16:54.805 --> 00:16:58.809
<font color="white">Jika pemerintah hapus jam praktik klinis</font><font color="white">
