<font color="white">Mustahil risiko itu diambil.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:17:01.478 --> 00:17:03.355
<font color="white">Semuanya pasti akan beres pekan ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:17:04.606 --> 00:17:05.733
<font color="white"><i>Pintu terbuka.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:17:19.371 --> 00:17:20.205
<font color="white">Ini benar-benar…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:17:32.134 --> 00:17:33.427
<font color="white">Astaga.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:17:34.011 --> 00:17:37.639
<font color="white">Tak kusangka Eung-gu mentraktir kita piza.</font><font color="white"></font>

