<font color="white">Ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:17:39.516 --> 00:17:41.435
<font color="white">Selamat sudah dapat pekerjaan, Eung-gu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:17:42.061 --> 00:17:44.271
