<font color="white">Bu Jang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:08.629 --> 00:18:09.546
<font color="white">Kau pasti untung besar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.340
<font color="white">Kalau begitu, boleh minta 2.000 won?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:14.593 --> 00:18:16.303
