00:18:16.386 --> 00:18:17.596
<font color="white">Tak makan juga.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:18.889 --> 00:18:21.308
<font color="white">Direktur Bu menyinggung soal Dokter X.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:22.434 --> 00:18:23.727
<font color="white">Tahu seberapa banyak dia?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:23.811 --> 00:18:24.937
<font color="white">Dia cuma baca artikel.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.522
<font color="white">Dia cuma mau melihat reaksiku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:26.605 --> 00:18:29.191
<font color="white">Kubalas dia dengan telak,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tapi aku masih gelisah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:18:29.274 --> 00:18:32.236
<font color="white">Sudah lama kita tak menyebut nama itu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:32.319 --> 00:18:33.612
