00:18:41.411 --> 00:18:42.538
<font color="white">Jangan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:55.551
<font color="white">Aku harus mengoperasinya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:56.593 --> 00:18:58.512
<font color="white">"Lee Hyeon-a, delapan tahun".</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:58.595 --> 00:19:00.639
<font color="white">NEOPLASMA GANAS</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">PADA JARINGAN IKAT DAN LUNAK ABDOMEN</font><font color="white"></font></font>

