{\an8}<font color="white">Tumor </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>myofibroblastic</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"> ganas?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:18.323
{\an8}<font color="white">Setahuku kasus IMT</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">biasanya dialami anak-anak,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:18.991 --> 00:19:20.993
{\an8}<font color="white">tapi transformasi ini…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:21.994 --> 00:19:24.204
<font color="white">Aku cuma pernah baca.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Tak pernah lihat langsung.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:26.248 --> 00:19:28.208
<font color="white">Ini kasus yang sangat langka.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:29.126 --> 00:19:30.002
<font color="white">Ukurannya 15 cm</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:30.878 --> 00:19:32.796
<font color="white">dan mengelilingi aorta abdomen.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:35.591 --> 00:19:38.177
<font color="white">Kenapa kalian, para dokter dunia barat,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">mendesah?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:39.386
<font color="white">Jelaskan padaku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:42.014 --> 00:19:43.640
<font color="white">Operasinya mustahil, Su-jeong.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:44.349 --> 00:19:46.018
<font color="white">Tak ada prosedur medisnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:46.101 --> 00:19:47.728
<font color="white">- Aku akan cari cara.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Jangan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:49.521 --> 00:19:50.355
<font color="white">Kenapa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:50.439 --> 00:19:53.275
<font color="white">Kau akan makin terlihat mirip Dokter X.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:06.205 --> 00:20:07.331
<font color="white">Ada surat untukmu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:12.085 --> 00:20:13.879
<font color="white">Jika tak mau balas, setidaknya baca.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:22.721 --> 00:20:24.348
<font color="white">Su-jeong bahkan tak bisa membacanya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:28.560
<font color="white">Lagi pula Baraka takkan hidup kembali.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:43.367 --> 00:20:44.201
<font color="white">Tidak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:45.035 --> 00:20:46.036
<font color="white">Pasti ada caranya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:47.788 --> 00:20:49.039
<font color="white">Berfokuslah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:51.959 --> 00:20:52.793
<font color="white">Makanlah sambil kerja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:55.128 --> 00:20:56.129
<font color="white">Ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:09.351 --> 00:21:10.894
<font color="white">Terima kasih, Eung-gu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:10.978 --> 00:21:12.604
<font color="white">Tahu tempat asal tantemu, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:15.774 --> 00:21:19.194
<font color="white">Semua orang di rumah ini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dihantui masa lalu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:21:22.656 --> 00:21:24.783
<font color="white">Konon tak ada tempat pelarian yang baik,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:25.993 --> 00:21:26.952
<font color="white">tapi terkadang,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:27.744 --> 00:21:28.870
<font color="white">aku senang di sini.</font><font color="white"></font>

