00:29:57.879 --> 00:30:01.424
<font color="white">Tapi menurut Dokter Gye,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">pasien ini masih punya harapan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:30:02.258 --> 00:30:03.092
<font color="white">Aku mau mengoperasinya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:03.676 --> 00:30:05.011
<font color="white">Tidak bisa. Ini…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:05.094 --> 00:30:05.929
<font color="white">Baiklah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:10.850 --> 00:30:12.352
<font color="white">Ayo gelar konferensi praoperasi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:18.566 --> 00:30:20.568
<font color="white">Yakinkan dokter-dokter lain.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:21.569 --> 00:30:22.904
<font color="white">KASUS 1: LEE HYEON-A, PEREMPUAN/8</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:22.987 --> 00:30:26.407
<font color="white">Aku gelar konferensi mendadak ini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">atas permintaan khusus.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:30:26.491 --> 00:30:28.576
<font color="white">Dari staf yang tersisa,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:28.660 --> 00:30:31.287
<font color="white">aku hanya mengundang dokter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang bisa bantu operasi ini,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:30:31.371 --> 00:30:32.413
<font color="white">jadi tolong dengarkan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:32.997 --> 00:30:35.542
<font color="white">Direktur Bu, operasi ini…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:35.625 --> 00:30:36.543
<font color="white">Siapa…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:37.168 --> 00:30:38.336
<font color="white">Siapa dokter utamanya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:39.128 --> 00:30:40.547
<font color="white">Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:44.133 --> 00:30:45.802
<font color="white">Nama pasiennya Lee Hyeon-a.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:45.885 --> 00:30:47.178
<font color="white">Umurnya delapan tahun,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:47.262 --> 00:30:48.972
{\an8}<font color="white">dia punya tumor </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>myofibroblastic</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"> ganas.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:30:50.056 --> 00:30:51.933
{\an8}<font color="white">Sudah menjalar ke lobus kaudatus, IVC,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:52.016 --> 00:30:53.685
<font color="white">kepala pankreas, vena porta,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:53.768 --> 00:30:55.854
<font color="white">SMV, SMA,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:55.937 --> 00:30:58.273
<font color="white">dan bahkan mesokolon.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:58.356 --> 00:30:59.732
<font color="white">Kami menolak kasus ini</font><font color="white"></font>

00:30:59.816 --> 00:31:02.527
<font color="white">karena tumornya menyebar amat luas</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan letaknya berisiko.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:31:02.610 --> 00:31:03.528
<font color="white">Kau benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:04.612 --> 00:31:06.239
<font color="white">Sangat berisiko.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:10.076 --> 00:31:13.746
<font color="white">Dia bisa bertahan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">paling lama tiga bulan lagi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:31:15.415 --> 00:31:19.085
<font color="white">Dokter Gye, kita semua prihatin</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dengan waktunya yang terbatas.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:31:19.168 --> 00:31:21.379
<font color="white">- Tapi…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Ukuran tumornya 15 cm.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:31:21.462 --> 00:31:23.506
<font color="white">Arteri utamanya terkena,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:23.590 --> 00:31:25.049
<font color="white">jadi aliran darah harus dihentikan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:25.133 --> 00:31:26.467
<font color="white">Dia tak bisa dioperasi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:26.551 --> 00:31:28.469
<font color="white">Sungguh tak ada prosedur bedahnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:28.553 --> 00:31:30.847
<font color="white">Masih ada.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:37.103 --> 00:31:40.565
{\an8}<font color="white">Kita akan lakukan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">reseksi tumor </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>ex vivo</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"> multiorgan</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:31:40.648 --> 00:31:41.900
{\an8}<font color="white">dan autotransplantasi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:42.692 --> 00:31:45.069
{\an8}<font color="white">Multi… auto… apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:47.238 --> 00:31:49.115
<font color="white">Total ada enam organ,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:49.198 --> 00:31:53.036
<font color="white">termasuk lambung,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">pankreas, limpa, lever, usus besar,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:31:53.119 --> 00:31:54.412
<font color="white">dan usus kecil,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:31:55.246 --> 00:31:57.498
<font color="white">yang akan diangkat dari tubuh</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bersama tumornya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:32:03.796 --> 00:32:05.298
<font color="white">Mungkinkah itu dilakukan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:05.381 --> 00:32:06.883
<font color="white">Apa operasi itu benar-benar ada?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:06.966 --> 00:32:08.551
<font color="white">Tidak ada.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:09.427 --> 00:32:10.553
<font color="white">Belum pernah kudengar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:10.637 --> 00:32:13.723
<font color="white">Mengangkat tumor langsung dari tempatnya</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:14.223 --> 00:32:19.145
<font color="white">akan terlalu lama karena sudah menjalar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">ke beberapa organ dan pembuluh darah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:32:19.646 --> 00:32:21.105
<font color="white">Tanpa aliran darah,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:21.189 --> 00:32:22.565
<font color="white">organ bisa mengalami nekrosis.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:22.649 --> 00:32:25.860
<font color="white">Itu sudah pasti, Dok.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Tapi kita tak bisa begitu saja…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:32:25.944 --> 00:32:26.778
<font color="white">Singkatnya,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:26.861 --> 00:32:30.323
<font color="white">angkat semua organ dari abdomen,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:30.406 --> 00:32:32.033
<font color="white">reseksi tumornya,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:32.116 --> 00:32:33.743
<font color="white">baru masukkan organnya kembali.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:33.826 --> 00:32:37.372
<font color="white">Kau anggap ini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">seperti transplantasi organ biasa…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:32:37.455 --> 00:32:38.289
<font color="white">Kau benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:39.999 --> 00:32:43.836
<font color="white">Berapa banyak pembuluh darah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang mau kau potong dan sambungkan lagi?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:32:43.920 --> 00:32:45.004
<font color="white">Mungkin banyak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:45.088 --> 00:32:47.340
<font color="white">- Sudah gila, ya, Dok?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Berapa lama?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:32:50.259 --> 00:32:51.177
<font color="white">Lima belas jam.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:51.761 --> 00:32:53.012
<font color="white">Lima belas jam?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:53.846 --> 00:32:55.765
<font color="white">Butuh enam jam</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">cuma untuk pasang dua organ.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:32:55.848 --> 00:32:57.850
<font color="white">Renungkan kembali ucapanmu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:57.934 --> 00:32:59.686
<font color="white">Takkan berhasil. Terlalu berisiko, Pak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:32:59.769 --> 00:33:00.645
<font color="white">Benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:01.479 --> 00:33:03.022
<font color="white">Operasi ini sangat berisiko.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:03.106 --> 00:33:04.315
<font color="white">Kau pernah melakukannya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:04.857 --> 00:33:06.359
<font color="white">Kau bicara seolah sudah berpengalaman.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:07.276 --> 00:33:08.528
<font color="white">Belum.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:08.611 --> 00:33:11.656
<font color="white">Kau mengusulkan prosedur</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang belum pernah kau lakukan?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:33:11.739 --> 00:33:13.491
<font color="white">Itu pasti gagal.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:13.574 --> 00:33:15.326
<font color="white">Mereka semua pasti sependapat denganku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:26.170 --> 00:33:27.880
<font color="white">Hei, kenapa kau tak mengatakannya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:28.673 --> 00:33:31.342
<font color="white">Kalimat andalanmu. "Aku tak pernah gagal".</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:33.011 --> 00:33:33.886
<font color="white">Kenapa tak bilang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:43.312 --> 00:33:44.397
<font color="white">Aku butuh tim.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:52.947 --> 00:33:54.699
<font color="white">Setelah keenam organ itu diangkat,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:54.782 --> 00:33:56.993
<font color="white">langsung dinginkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dalam cairan preservasi,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:33:57.076 --> 00:33:59.495
<font color="white">sementara tim melakukan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">reseksi tumornya di meja lain</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:34:00.079 --> 00:34:02.623
<font color="white">dan melakukan rekonstruksi vaskular.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:05.168 --> 00:34:08.713
<font color="white">Anak itu hanya bisa bertahan sebentar,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:09.255 --> 00:34:13.342
<font color="white">jadi dokter bedah harus bentuk tim</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan bekerja bersamaan untuk hemat waktu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:34:13.426 --> 00:34:15.803
<font color="white">Ganti pembuluh yang diinvasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dengan pembuluh sintetis,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:34:15.887 --> 00:34:18.097
<font color="white">lalu implan kembali organnya</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:18.181 --> 00:34:20.224
<font color="white">dan pulihkan aliran darahnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:21.726 --> 00:34:25.271
<font color="white">Bagaimana jika tumornya menjalar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">ke ekor pankreas?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:34:25.354 --> 00:34:26.189
<font color="white">Harus bagaimana?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:26.272 --> 00:34:27.732
<font color="white">Angkat seluruh pankreasnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:28.483 --> 00:34:31.194
<font color="white">Tapi biopsi akan dilakukan saat operasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk mencegah…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:34:31.277 --> 00:34:32.779
{\an8}<font color="white">Kita akan bawa ini ke IRB.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:32.862 --> 00:34:34.113
{\an8}<font color="white">IRB (KOMITE ETIK PENELITIAN)</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:36.949 --> 00:34:39.160
<font color="white">Setiap prosedur bedah baru</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:39.243 --> 00:34:41.245
<font color="white">harus disetujui IRB.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:41.329 --> 00:34:43.247
<font color="white">Ini bukan prosedur yang sama sekali baru.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:43.331 --> 00:34:47.168
<font color="white">Prosedur yang belum pernah ada</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">butuh persetujuan IRB.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:34:47.835 --> 00:34:49.504
<font color="white">Susun berkas-berkas operasinya,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:49.587 --> 00:34:51.130
<font color="white">minta persetujuan pasien, lalu ajukan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:51.756 --> 00:34:53.049
<font color="white">Berapa lama persetujuannya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:53.132 --> 00:34:55.134
<font color="white">Biasanya seminggu, jadi tunggu saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:55.218 --> 00:34:57.678
<font color="white">Sudah terlambat. Kita tak bisa menunggu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:58.513 --> 00:34:59.430
<font color="white">Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:01.516 --> 00:35:04.560
<font color="white">Menurutmu, ada yang berpartisipasi?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:06.479 --> 00:35:08.731
<font color="white">Operasi ini praktis seperti spekulasi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:08.815 --> 00:35:11.442
<font color="white">Apa kau mempertaruhkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">nyawa anak delapan tahun,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:35:11.526 --> 00:35:12.819
<font color="white">membahayakan kariermu</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:13.528 --> 00:35:15.947
<font color="white">dan karier orang lain?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:19.826 --> 00:35:23.704
<font color="white">Aku mempertaruhkan reputasiku</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebagai dokter bedah</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:35:24.914 --> 00:35:27.875
<font color="white">demi menyelamatkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">pasien berumur delapan tahun.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:35:28.835 --> 00:35:29.836
<font color="white">Kalau begitu, tunggu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:30.670 --> 00:35:32.421
<font color="white">Bukankah kau butuh tim</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:32.505 --> 00:35:35.049
<font color="white">dan ruang operasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang bisa digunakan seharian?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:35:36.175 --> 00:35:38.136
<font color="white">Patuhi protokol,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">begitu kau dapat persetujuan…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:35:38.219 --> 00:35:39.137
<font color="white">Anak itu</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:39.804 --> 00:35:41.305
<font color="white">tak punya waktu lagi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:42.431 --> 00:35:44.142
<font color="white">Kalau begitu, dua hari lagi bagaimana?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:45.935 --> 00:35:47.311
<font color="white">Tentunya itu menjadi hari</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:47.395 --> 00:35:50.690
<font color="white">kau bisa menggunakan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">ruang operasi utama seharian.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:35:50.773 --> 00:35:52.733
<font color="white">Semua ruang operasi juga kosong hari itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:54.902 --> 00:35:58.531
<font color="white">Itu hari unjuk rasa dan pemungutan suara</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">pengunduran diri serumah sakit.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:35:59.574 --> 00:36:01.909
<font color="white">Kurasa kita semua menerima pesan ini,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:01.993 --> 00:36:03.286
<font color="white">kecuali Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:04.453 --> 00:36:08.249
<font color="white">Kalian semua akan ikut mogok kerja, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:11.252 --> 00:36:13.045
<font color="white">Biar kutanya hadirin sekarang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:16.257 --> 00:36:17.091
<font color="white">Begini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:18.134 --> 00:36:20.511
<font color="white">Adakah dokter senior di sini</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:22.054 --> 00:36:23.556
<font color="white">yang mau masuk tim</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebagai asisten bedah utama?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:36:35.735 --> 00:36:36.986
<font color="white">Serahkan dokumennya dulu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:38.446 --> 00:36:40.531
<font color="white">Ulur waktu untuk meyakinkan mereka.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:40.615 --> 00:36:41.782
<font color="white">Saat ini,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:42.366 --> 00:36:43.826
<font color="white">tak akan ada yang angkat tangan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:51.959 --> 00:36:54.003
<font color="white">Mereka tak akan hadir.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:55.630 --> 00:36:57.340
<font color="white">Ini bukan masalah IRB dan mogok kerja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:58.633 --> 00:36:59.842
<font color="white">Mereka sendiri masalahnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:00.343 --> 00:37:01.510
<font color="white">Aku tanya sekali lagi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:02.386 --> 00:37:04.263
<font color="white">Adakah dokter senior di sini</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:05.097 --> 00:37:07.475
<font color="white">yang mau masuk tim</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebagai asisten bedah utama?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:37:27.495 --> 00:37:30.122
<font color="white">KASUS 1: LEE HYEON-A, PEREMPUAN/8</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">RIWAYAT PERAWATAN</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:38:03.489 --> 00:38:04.907
<font color="white">Tolonglah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:38.691 --> 00:38:39.984
<font color="white">Sungguh tak kusangka.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:41.110 --> 00:38:44.155
<font color="white">Seburuk apa pun kondisinya,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">mundur seperti itu memalukan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:38:44.655 --> 00:38:46.282
<font color="white">Jika kalian tak punya keberanian,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:46.365 --> 00:38:49.327
<font color="white">setidaknya dukung orang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang berani bertindak.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:38:49.952 --> 00:38:51.495
<font color="white">Aksi mogok kerja? IRB?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:51.579 --> 00:38:53.164
<font color="white">Itu semua cuma alasan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:53.873 --> 00:38:55.624
<font color="white">Akan kuingat setiap orang</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:56.250 --> 00:38:58.210
<font color="white">yang keluar dari pintu itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:58.878 --> 00:39:00.671
<font color="white">Seharusnya kalian semua malu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:08.095 --> 00:39:10.806
<font color="white">Tak kusangka mereka tak berani bertindak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:12.224 --> 00:39:13.934
<font color="white">Dia bahkan sampai merendahkan diri.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:14.018 --> 00:39:15.603
<font color="white">Aku tak merendahkan diri.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:15.686 --> 00:39:16.854
<font color="white">Aku cuma membungkuk.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:25.196 --> 00:39:26.364
<font color="white">Aku kecewa, tapi ini enak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:29.492 --> 00:39:30.868
<font color="white">Omong-omong, Dokter Gye,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:31.744 --> 00:39:33.329
<font color="white">aku tetap merasa kau luar biasa.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:33.412 --> 00:39:34.872
<font color="white">Kau hebat sekali tadi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:35.373 --> 00:39:38.000
<font color="white">Benar. Aku sependapat dengannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:39.460 --> 00:39:41.962
<font color="white">Dokter Gye, kau keren sekali.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:44.006 --> 00:39:45.257
