01:02:09.434 --> 01:02:10.643
<font color="white">Aku bisa gila.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:10.727 --> 01:02:13.312
<font color="white">Tensi 50 per 30. Jika drop lagi…</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:13.396 --> 01:02:14.605
<font color="white">Kerusakan otak terjadi.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:14.689 --> 01:02:15.773
<font color="white">Aku tahu itu, Bocah.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:16.274 --> 01:02:18.526
<font color="white">Pergi panggil seseorang.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:18.609 --> 01:02:22.530
<font color="white">Panggil siapa pun yang bisa bantu.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kita kekurangan tenaga.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:02:22.613 --> 01:02:25.867
<font color="white">Pokoknya bawa seseorang ke sini!</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:49.599 --> 01:02:51.559
<font color="white">Aku dr. Jang Hui-suk, dokter bedah.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:54.479 --> 01:02:55.396
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:56.230 --> 01:02:57.565
<font color="white">Siapa?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:57.648 --> 01:02:59.358
<font color="white">Siapa… Siapa kau?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:59.442 --> 01:03:00.777
<font color="white">Jang Hui-suk?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:00.860 --> 01:03:01.903
<font color="white">Bu Jang?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:02.779 --> 01:03:03.863
<font color="white"><i>Harmonic</i></font><font color="white"><font color="white">, tolong.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:03:03.946 --> 01:03:06.324
<font color="white">Apa katamu? Bu Jang?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:06.407 --> 01:03:08.785
<font color="white">Apa? Katakan lagi, siapa?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:09.660 --> 01:03:10.536
<font color="white">Dia…</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:11.078 --> 01:03:12.288
<font color="white">mentorku.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:27.720 --> 01:03:30.681
<font color="white">DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE</font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:09.804 --> 01:04:12.765
<font color="white">DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE</font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:12.849 --> 01:04:14.892
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Akan kupastikan</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:14.976 --> 01:04:16.978
{\an8}<font color="white">Hyeon-a bisa tumbuh besar.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:17.061 --> 01:04:18.688
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Jika kita dokter,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:18.771 --> 01:04:20.815
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>seharusnya di mana kita sekarang?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:21.566 --> 01:04:23.067
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Hentikan operasinya!</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:23.150 --> 01:04:25.945
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Kami akan menuntaskan operasi ini.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:26.028 --> 01:04:28.072
{\an8}<font color="white">Kalian mengabaikannya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">agar bisa melakukan operasi</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:04:28.155 --> 01:04:29.407
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>dan membahayakan pasien.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:29.490 --> 01:04:32.034
{\an8}<font color="white">Rumah sakit ini kekurangan staf</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">karena mogok kerja.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:04:32.118 --> 01:04:35.162
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Aku tak menyesal</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>terlibat dalam operasi ini.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:35.246 --> 01:04:36.330
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Gye Su-jeong.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:36.914 --> 01:04:38.666
